arbeitnow:ai-full-stack-developer-133361:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an AI Full-Stack Developer to build and scale automation solutions across internal company processes using AI, LLMs, and agent-based systems. This role focuses on delivering practical automation solutions, integrating AI capabilities with internal tools, and orchestrating workflows across multiple systems, with a dynamic range of tasks that offer both quick wins and complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-driven automation solutions using LLMs, APIs, and agent frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop systems to automate document processing, data extraction, and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement multi-step automated workflows connecting AI models and internal services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate automation solutions with internal systems such as HR, finance, legal, dashboards, and ticketing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver and iterate practical automation solutions swiftly, from simple GPT/AI integrations to complex workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and support internal teams on newly built or optimized systems for strong adoption and self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Technical Team Lead, Product Manager, and IT teams on architecture and system integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly with internal stakeholders and external partners or vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working as a Full-Stack Developer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, and React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services and API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with LLM APIs or AI-based services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with AI developer ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to use AI-assisted coding tools effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow automation systems or distributed architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI agents or multi-step AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with prompt engineering or LLM orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with enterprise systems or internal business tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with event-driven architectures, queues, and task orchestration systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in teaching non-technical users how to utilize developed systems effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What's it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-ai-engineer-technical-c:
&lt;h2 data-start="107" data-end="126"&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="127" data-end="406"&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="408" data-end="795"&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="797" data-end="821"&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="822" data-end="1096"&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start="827" data-end="879"&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="1098" data-end="2600"&gt;
&lt;li data-start="1098" data-end="1326"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1100" data-end="1326"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1100" data-end="1141"&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="1327" data-end="1512"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1329" data-end="1512"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1329" data-end="1360"&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="1513" data-end="1754"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1515" data-end="1754"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1515" data-end="1551"&gt;Advanced programming &amp;amp; modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, adapt, and evaluate ML/DL/LLM models using Python (PyTorch, TensorFlow, HuggingFace, LangChain/LlamaIndex), including prompt engineering, fine-tuning/LoRA, vector search, and safety/guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="1755" data-end="1927"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1757" data-end="1927"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1757" data-end="1782"&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate solutions on Azure, GCP, or AWS (CI/CD, containers, model serving, feature stores, vector DBs, monitoring, eval pipelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="1928" data-end="2127"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1930" data-end="2127"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1930" data-end="1975"&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business goals into technical roadmaps, present to senior stakeholders, manage risks and trade-offs, and ensure measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="2128" data-end="2265"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2130" data-end="2265"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="2130" data-end="2165"&gt;Quality, security &amp;amp; governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce best practices on data privacy, model risk management, responsible AI, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="2266" data-end="2425"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2268" data-end="2425"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="2268" data-end="2300"&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach engineers/consultants, perform code and design reviews, and help shape delivery standards and reusable accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="2426" data-end="2600"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2428" data-end="2600"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="2428" data-end="2463"&gt;Pre-sales &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support proposals, estimates, and statements of work; contribute to assets, talks, and publications that advance Artefact’s AI offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="2602" data-end="2622"&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2623" data-end="2715"&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="2717" data-end="3945"&gt;
&lt;li data-start="2717" data-end="2874"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2719" data-end="2874"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="2719" data-end="2734"&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5–8+ years in data/ML/AI engineering or adjacent roles, including &lt;strong data-start="2801" data-end="2849"&gt;end-to-end delivery of production AI systems&lt;/strong&gt; (not just prototypes).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="2875" data-end="3010"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2877" data-end="3010"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="2877" data-end="2893"&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert Python; solid software engineering (testing, packaging, CI/CD). SQL required; Java/Scala/TypeScript a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3011" data-end="3145"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3013" data-end="3145"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3013" data-end="3023"&gt;AI/ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on with ML/DL and &lt;strong data-start="3048" data-end="3056"&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; (prompting, fine-tuning/LoRA, embeddings/RAG, evaluation &amp;amp; observability, guardrails).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3146" data-end="3266"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3148" data-end="3266"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3148" data-end="3158"&gt;Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience on &lt;strong data-start="3178" data-end="3194"&gt;at least one&lt;/strong&gt; major cloud (Azure, GCP, or AWS) deploying secure, scalable services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3267" data-end="3504"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3269" data-end="3504"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3269" data-end="3286"&gt;MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Containers (Docker/Kubernetes), Git, pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions/Cloud-native), model serving (FastAPI/TorchServe/Triton), experiment tracking, model registry, vector DBs (FAISS, Pinecone, pgvector, OpenSearch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3505" data-end="3640"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3507" data-end="3640"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3507" data-end="3531"&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing data/ML platforms, APIs, microservices; familiarity with data pipelines and streaming is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3641" data-end="3761"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3643" data-end="3761"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3643" data-end="3665"&gt;Consulting skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements gathering, storytelling, senior stakeholder management, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3762" data-end="3876"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3764" data-end="3876"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3764" data-end="3778"&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start="3779" data-end="3812"&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written &amp;amp; spoken).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3877" data-end="3945"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3879" data-end="3945"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3879" data-end="3900"&gt;Work eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3947" data-end="3963"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="3947" data-end="3963"&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="3964" data-end="4225"&gt;
&lt;li data-start="3964" data-end="4062"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3966" data-end="4062"&gt;Experience with responsible AI/governance frameworks, security reviews, and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4063" data-end="4158"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4065" data-end="4158"&gt;Domain experience in one or more industries (e.g., retail, pharma, manufacturing, finance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4159" data-end="4225"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4161" data-end="4225"&gt;Contributions to open-source, publications, or conference talks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="4227" data-end="4241"&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="4242" data-end="4752"&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4242" data-end="4359"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4244" data-end="4359"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="4244" data-end="4274"&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate at the intersection of boardroom strategy and cutting-edge AI engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4360" data-end="4494"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4362" data-end="4494"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="4362" data-end="4389"&gt;Romandie Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one; help shape our Swiss footprint and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4495" data-end="4630"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4497" data-end="4630"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="4497" data-end="4519"&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced training across strategy, AI/ML/LLM, and cloud; international missions and communities of practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start="4631" data-end="4752"&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4633" data-end="4752"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="4633" data-end="4654"&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We move fast, deliver impact, and support each other’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4754" data-end="4796"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="4754" data-end="4767"&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lausanne / Geneva (Romandie)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4798" data-end="4942" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Passion, curiosity, and impact orientation matter — tell us about yours.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:majors-account-executive-15743:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;About Rubrik&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="4"&gt;Rubrik is on a mission to secure the world’s data. We are the pioneer of Zero Trust Data Security™, helping organizations achieve business resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions. Rubrik’s Centralized Data Management and Protection platform keeps enterprise data safe, discoverable, and always available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5"&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="5"&gt;Major Account Executive for Germany&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive new and existing business across specific verticals within the region, focusing on top-tier, large Enterprise accounts. You will achieve this through strategic partner planning, direct pipeline generation, and executing a sophisticated cyber-resilience sales strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="7"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Where You Can Make An Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="8"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Territory Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute comprehensive sales plans within your assigned German territory to consistently meet and exceed quota through rigorous prospecting, qualifying, managing, and closing of complex sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Pipeline Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and manage a robust sales pipeline, effectively moving high-value, strategic transactions through the enterprise sales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;New Logo Acquisition &amp;amp; Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and close net-new opportunities while strategically expanding Rubrik’s footprint within existing mid-to-large enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Channel Ecosystem Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-sell and strategize with key local partners, distributors, and VARs across Germany to accelerate market penetration and build a scalable growth engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide leadership with actionable feedback regarding the German market landscape, emerging regulatory trends (e.g., NIS2, DORA), and new business or channel partnership opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="10"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="11"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideally 10+ years of successful technology sales experience, specifically selling IT Infrastructure, SaaS, Cyber Security, or Enterprise Storage &amp;amp; Backup solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; A consistent history of landing net-new enterprise logos and driving significant expansion within existing Tier 1/Major German enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Pipeline Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on and proactive with pipeline generation activities; collaborative with inside sales and partner teams, but entirely self-reliant when it comes to hunting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Partner Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong, pre-existing relationships within the German partner ecosystem, including major technology partners, top-tier resellers, and regional/global System Integrators (SIs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Value Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; High-level understanding of complex enterprise customer infrastructures and the ability to articulate business value up to the C-suite (CISO, CIO, CFO).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Trained in the &lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,5,0" data-index-in-node="28"&gt;MEDDPICC&lt;/strong&gt; sales methodology (highly advantageous).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,6,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,6,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent/Native &lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,6,0" data-index-in-node="31"&gt;German&lt;/strong&gt; and professional proficiency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,6,0" data-index-in-node="70"&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; are required for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,7,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,7,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Core Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; Naturally driven, hungry for success, collaborative, and highly coachable with a strong sense of integrity. You are fiercely competitive yet value a team-first culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World's AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/"&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/rubrikinc"&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/" target="_blank"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.rubrik.com"&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1;"&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 1;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1;"&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or protected veteran status and will not be discriminated against on the basis of disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability or genetics. In addition to federal law requirements, Rubrik complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal law requires employers to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities. Please contact us at ----- if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or to perform your job. Examples of reasonable accommodation include making a change to the application process or work procedures, providing documents in an alternate format, using a sign language interpreter, or using specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:maintenance-operations-continu:
&lt;section class="section vacancy-detail-intro-section"&gt;
&lt;div class="section-inner"&gt;
&lt;div class="entry-intro"&gt;
&lt;section class="section vacancy-detail-intro-section"&gt;
&lt;div class="section-inner"&gt;
&lt;div class="entry-intro"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kurz und knapp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unsere Fulfilment Center gehören zu den modernsten ihrer Art und beliefern täglich tausende Haushalte mit frischen Lebensmitteln. Als nächstes wollen wir im Raum Berlin/Brandenburg (Falkensee) unser brandneues hybrides Fulfilment Center öffnen. Falkensee gehört zu den ersten Standorten, an denen wir die Instandhaltung unserer automatisierten Anlagen intern aufbauen, statt vollständig auszulagern. Als Maintenance Operations &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement Manager (m/w/d) übernimmst du die strategische Verantwortung für die Performance und kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung unserer Material-Handling-Anlagen und Instandhaltungsprozesse am Standort.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du bist die zentrale Schnittstelle zwischen den automatisierten und manuellen Prozessen im Fulfilment Center, den operativen Teams, deinem Maintenance Team, unseren Engineering- und Analytics-Teams sowie externen Partnern. Du übersetzt übergeordnete Standortziele in konkrete Verbesserungsinitiativen, nutzt Daten zur Identifikation von Optimierungspotenzialen und sorgst dafür, dass Anlagenverfügbarkeit, operative Effizienz und kontinuierliche Verbesserung langfristig auf einem hohen Niveau bleiben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="580" data-end="835" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/50pQKpPc24E" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Steuere den Maintenance-Bereich im Tagesgeschäft und unterstütze Maintenance Engineers und Supervisor dabei, ihre Teams effektiv zu führen. Du sorgst für die richtigen Strukturen und Prioritäten und stellst gemeinsam mit deinem Team die Erreichung unserer Ziele zur Anlagenverfügbarkeit sicher - ohne selbst jedes operative Detail zu steuern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Verantwortung für den Maintenance-Bereich:&lt;/strong&gt; Entwickle die langfristige Performance-Strategie für unseren Maintenance-Bereich und übernimm Verantwortung für zentrale KPIs in den Bereichen Sicherheit, Qualität, Durchsatz und operative Effizienz.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kontinuierliche Verbesserung &amp;amp; Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Treibe standortweite Kaizen-Initiativen, Lean-Methoden und Root-Cause-Analysen voran. Du identifizierst strukturelle Verbesserungspotenziale und sorgst dafür, dass kontinuierliche Verbesserung fester Bestandteil unserer Arbeitsweise wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datenbasierte Prozess- und Automatisierungsoptimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Analysiere komplexe operative und technische Prozesse anhand von Daten, identifiziere Engpässe und entwickle gemeinsam mit den technischen Teams Lösungen, um die Zuverlässigkeit und Verfügbarkeit unserer Anlagen nachhaltig zu verbessern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schnittstelle über verschiedene Bereiche hinweg:&lt;/strong&gt; Bringe Maintenance, Engineering, unsere Lieferanten, Planung, Analytics und Operations zusammen und sorge dafür, dass alle Beteiligten auf gemeinsame Ziele hinarbeiten und die Prozesse entlang der gesamten Wertschöpfungskette reibungslos funktionieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Stelle gemeinsam mit den verantwortlichen Teams die Einhaltung von Sicherheitsstandards, 5S-Prinzipien und operativen Best Practices am gesamten Standort sicher - mit Fokus auf Strukturen und Standards statt auf die tägliche technische Detailsteuerung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masterabschluss (MSc) in Supply Chain Management, Ingenieurwesen oder einem vergleichbaren technischen bzw. analytischen Studiengang/Abschluss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Jahre Berufserfahrung mit Schwerpunkt auf Instandhaltung, operativer Strategie, Continuous Improvement oder Prozessengineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starkes Interesse an Automatisierung, Robotik und technischen Instandhaltungssystemen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisbare Erfahrung mit Lean, Six Sigma oder Kaizen - idealerweise in einem automatisierten high-volume Umfeld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute analytische Fähigkeiten und Erfahrung mit Datenanalyse-Tools wie Tableau, Excel, Sheets oder SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategische Denkweise sowie die Fähigkeit, bereichsübergreifend Einfluss zu nehmen und größere Initiativen voranzutreiben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikations- und Kooperationsfähigkeit sowie Freude daran, unterschiedliche Stakeholder zusammenzubringen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Englischkenntnisse, Deutschkenntnisse sind ein großes Plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darauf kannst du dich freuen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starte durch - mit uns: &lt;/strong&gt;Werde Teil unseres internationalen Teams in einem Umfeld, das echtes Wachstum und eine „Act like an Owner“-Mentalität fördert. Bei uns hast du die Chance, Projekte eigenverantwortlich voranzutreiben, neue Ideen zu testen und direkt miterleben zu können, wie deine Arbeit in unserem schnell wachsenden Unternehmen Wirkung zeigt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachhaltigkeit als Kern:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil der Revolution. Du trägst zu einer grüneren Zukunft bei - durch unsere 100 % elektrische Flotte und eine Lieferkette, die Lebensmittelverschwendung reduziert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Basics:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir stellen dir alles für deinen Erfolg bereit - inklusive Laptop und Handy sowie Zugang zu exklusiven Mitarbeiter-Rabatten (Corporate Benefits) für Reisen, Technik und vieles mehr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zeit zum Auftanken: &lt;/strong&gt;Mit 30 Urlaubstagen pro Jahr (bei einer 40-Stunden-Woche) sorgst du für den perfekten Ausgleich zwischen Arbeit und Erholung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verpflegung für Gewinner: &lt;/strong&gt;Wir kümmern uns um dich. Genieße jeden Tag ein frisches, kostenloses Frühstück und Mittag- oder Abendessen in unserem Fulfilment Center, dazu gibt es reichlich Snacks und Obst für den Energiekick zwischendurch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unvergessliche Momente:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir sind mehr als nur ein Team. Von unserem legendären jährlichen Ski-Trip über Weihnachtsfeiern bis hin zu Auftritten unserer eigenen Picnic-Band: Wir feiern unsere Erfolge gemeinsam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wohlbefinden &amp;amp; Gleichgewicht: &lt;/strong&gt;Wir bieten dir professionelle Unterstützung für deine mentale Gesundheit mit OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-software-engineer-add-o:
&lt;div class="gmail_default" style="font-size: small;"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute open-source software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this team and role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;addons.mozilla.org (AMO) is the foundation of the Firefox add-ons ecosystem. It’s a showcase for developers to publish and grow their extensions, and a place of discovery for millions of users who customize Firefox to make it their own. Behind the scenes are the DevHub which enables developers to manage their extensions. To manage the ecosystem there are a series of Reviewer tools and automated moderation systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you’ll bring a passion for crafting resilient systems that accelerate our review and moderation teams to provide a first-class experience for Add-on developers. You’ll work closely with engineers, reviewers, developer support, and Add-ons leadership to turn ideas into polished features, modernize the platform and its architecture, and see your work reach millions of people around the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Deliver major features and architectural improvements across the Add-ons stack, including automated moderation pipelines, Reviewer tools, and DevHub.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Help establish and maintain engineering standards across areas such as code review, definition of done, production readiness, runbooks, incident response, on-call practices, coding conventions, and infrastructure as code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Create robust observability systems and data-backed insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Provide peer feedback, share knowledge and help others grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Build and improve the systems that enable Add-ons engineering to safely develop, deploy, observe, and operate production services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Improve our CI/CD pipelines using declarative, pipeline-as-code approaches that make changes reproducible, testable, and easy to review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Deliver work iteratively using a visible backlog, short feedback cycles, retrospectives, and demonstrations to stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Write clear technical documentation, including design notes, Architecture Decision Records, runbooks, and incident write-ups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Work effectively in unfamiliar codebases, tracing requests and asynchronous jobs end-to-end to understand failures and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Collaborate with designers, product managers, QA, and community contributors to deliver end-to-end improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Contribute in the open through pull requests, code reviews, and discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Work on:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; submission flows, trust and safety signals, DevHub and Reviewer tools modernization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AMO application systems: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Work within our Python/Django, MySQL, React/TypeScript, and asynchronous processing systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal developer platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;: Create tools and paved paths that make it easier for teams to ship and operate software safely and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Process: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Contribute to team ceremonies, execute process improvement, and provide feedback on team effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;: Help make production readiness, testing, recoverability, documentation, and safe deployment part of the normal development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform reliability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; Deployments, monitoring, and incident response.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong hands-on experience building and maintaining production applications with Python/Django.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience operating and improving production software systems where reliability and safe delivery matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong experience with CI/CD systems and treating pipelines and infrastructure declaratively as code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience designing or improving automated testing and deployment workflows, including integration testing and staged or progressive delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong understanding of observability as an engineering discipline, including metrics, logging, tracing, service-level objectives, and actionable alerting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience building or maintaining internal tools or platforms used by other engineering teams, with an understanding that internal systems have users, reliability expectations, roadmaps, and lifecycle considerations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience defining or improving engineering practices such as code review standards, operational readiness, runbooks, incident response, on-call expectations, or definitions of done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Ability to read and understand unfamiliar codebases and trace application behavior across frontend, backend, asynchronous jobs, data stores, and infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience debugging complex production issues and turning what you learn into lasting system improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong technical writing skills, with experience creating useful documentation such as design documents, ADRs, runbooks, and incident reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience working iteratively with a visible backlog, regular stakeholder feedback, and retrospectives that result in concrete improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills in a distributed team environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;A willingness to share knowledge and mentor peers in operational and reliability practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Commitment to our values:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Welcoming differences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Being relationship-minded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Practicing responsible participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Having grit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience with Google Cloud and operating Kubernetes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code tooling and policy-as-code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience establishing SLOs and error-budget-based reliability practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience with chaos engineering, disaster recovery testing, or production readiness reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience with trust and safety, automated moderation, abuse prevention, or other adversarial systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Contributions to open source projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style="color: #003366;"&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class="external-link" ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
